<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela bolivar ends off as CenBank stays away.</title>
<headline>Venezuela bolivar ends off as CenBank stays away.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Venezuelan bolivar closed off at 477.00/478.00 per dollar in quiet trade on Tuesday after the Central Bank uncharacteristically abstained from supplying dollars to the market, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;Although the Bank didn't come in today, I'm sure it will return tomorrow and firm up the bolivar once again,&quot; said one trader.</p>
<p>The unit closed Monday at 476.25/477.50 per dollar.</p>
<p>((-- Silene Ramirez, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
